      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, I would like to add that the logs say this:\n[Always] Removing VRCPickup comp from original\n[Always] Removing VRCSpatialAudioSource comp from original\nThis gets logged on an uploaded world just before the cloning happens, resulting in a useless original and clone. \nYou can use the original until the cloning occurs just fine.\nHowever, as mentioned in the canny, nothing like this gets logged in local testing, it just works in there as one would expect.\nAs logs show, other components may be affected as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
